{"seq":1,"slug":"cpu-controller-weight-bandwidth","title":"CPU 控制器：cpu.weight 权重分摊与 cpu.max 带宽限流","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/linux-cgroup-v2-resource-isolation-deep-dive/resource-controllers-deep/cpu-controller-weight-bandwidth","wordCount":2578,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"cpu-控制器-cpu-weight-权重分摊与-cpu-max-带宽限流\">CPU 控制器：cpu.weight 权重分摊与 cpu.max 带宽限流</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>cgroup v2 的 CPU 控制器把「一个 cgroup 能拿到多少 CPU」拆成两个正交的旋钮：<strong>相对份额</strong>（<code>cpu.weight</code>）和<strong>绝对上限</strong>（<code>cpu.max</code>）。理解它们的关键，是分清二者生效的条件完全不同——权重只在 CPU 真正被争抢时才决定分配比例，配额则无论机器空闲与否都硬性生效。</p>\n<p>内核文档对这套通用模型的原话是：所有控制器权重都落在 <code>[1, 10000]</code> 区间、默认值 <code>100</code>，&quot;giving each the fraction matching the ratio of its weight against the sum&quot;（按权重占比分配给每个子组），并明确 <code>cpu.weight</code> 是这种按比例分配 CPU 周期的控制器实例（来源：kernel.org <code>Documentation/admin-guide/cgroup-v2.html</code> §Control Group v2 → CPU）。而 <code>cpu.max</code> 属于另一类——带宽控制（bandwidth control），格式是 <code>$MAX $PERIOD</code>，默认 <code>&quot;max 100000&quot;</code>，即「无上限、周期 100 毫秒」。</p>\n<p>两个旋钮都属于 v2 的<strong>层级</strong>语义：权重在每一层的兄弟之间递归分摊；配额则沿祖先链层层收紧，子 cgroup 的实际可用带宽不可能超过任一祖先的上限。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[&quot;根 cgroup&lt;br/&gt;cpu.max = max&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;租户 A&lt;br/&gt;weight=300&lt;br/&gt;cpu.max = 400000 100000&quot;]&#10;  A --&gt; C[&quot;租户 B&lt;br/&gt;weight=700&lt;br/&gt;cpu.max = max 100000&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; B1[&quot;订单服务&lt;br/&gt;weight=100&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; B2[&quot;推荐服务&lt;br/&gt;weight=200&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; C1[&quot;离线批处理&lt;br/&gt;weight=1000&quot;]\">graph TD\n  A[\"根 cgroup&lt;br/&gt;cpu.max = max\"] --&gt; B[\"租户 A&lt;br/&gt;weight=300&lt;br/&gt;cpu.max = 400000 100000\"]\n  A --&gt; C[\"租户 B&lt;br/&gt;weight=700&lt;br/&gt;cpu.max = max 100000\"]\n  B --&gt; B1[\"订单服务&lt;br/&gt;weight=100\"]\n  B --&gt; B2[\"推荐服务&lt;br/&gt;weight=200\"]\n  C --&gt; C1[\"离线批处理&lt;br/&gt;weight=1000\"]</pre><p>图中可以看到两条约束同时作用：租户 A 与 B 在根层按 300:700 分摊争抢到的 CPU；而租户 A 内部即使把子组权重调得再高，A 整棵树也逃不出 <code>cpu.max</code> 给出的 4 个核上限。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>cgroup v1（已废弃）</th>\n<th>cgroup v2</th>\n<th>语义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>cpu.shares</code>（默认 1024，范围 2–262144）</td>\n<td><code>cpu.weight</code>（默认 100，范围 1–10000）</td>\n<td>相对份额，仅在争抢时生效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>cpu.cfs_quota_us</code> + <code>cpu.cfs_period_us</code></td>\n<td><code>cpu.max</code>（<code>$MAX $PERIOD</code>，微秒）</td>\n<td>每周期运行时预算，硬上限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>cpu.cfs_burst_us</code></td>\n<td><code>cpu.max.burst</code>（默认 0，范围 <code>[0, $MAX]</code>）</td>\n<td>允许累积的突发预算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无</td>\n<td><code>cpu.weight.nice</code>（-20–19）</td>\n<td>用 nice 值表达的权重别名</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>每 CPU 独立预算</td>\n<td>整组共享单一预算</td>\n<td>节流按 cgroup 而非按 CPU 计时</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张映射表是迁移期最容易出错的对照：v1 的 <code>cpu.shares</code> 不是线性等于 v2 的 <code>cpu.weight</code>，两者区间不同，必须换算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"cpu-weight-权重分摊的机制与换算\">cpu.weight：权重分摊的机制与换算</h2><p><code>cpu.weight</code> 的语义是「在 CPU 饱和时，我相对于兄弟拿多少」。它读写在非根 cgroup 上，默认 <code>100</code>，非 idle 组（<code>cpu.idle = 0</code>）的有效范围是 <code>[1, 10000]</code>（kernel.org cgroup-v2 文档）。当同层有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个可运行子组、权重为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、该层可分的总算力为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 时，第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 组的份额是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mrow><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_i = C \\cdot \\frac{w_i}{\\sum_{j=1}^{n} w_j}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2377em;vertical-align:-1.1301em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3057em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8043em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1301em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>举例：4 核机器上三个兄弟 cgroup 权重分别为 100、200、700，空闲时各自都能跑满；一旦同时压满 CPU，则分得 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mn>100</mn><mn>1000</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0.4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4 \\times \\frac{100}{1000} = 0.4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1000</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">100</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.4</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.8</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2.8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2.8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.8</span></span></span></span></span> 核。注意分母只统计<strong>活跃</strong>子组——一个权重 1000 但当前空闲的兄弟不会稀释别人的份额。这点在共享节点上很关键：权重含义是&quot;空闲让出、争抢时按比例&quot;，不是固定预留。</p>\n<p>从 v1 迁移时，内核给出的换算是把 <code>[2, 262144]</code> 线性映射到 <code>[1, 10000]</code>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mn>9999</mn></mrow><mn>262142</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w = 1 + \\frac{(s - 2) \\times 9999}{262142}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.113em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">262142</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">9999</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 是原 <code>cpu.shares</code>。验证端点：<code>shares=2</code> 得 <code>weight=1</code>，<code>shares=262144</code> 得 <code>weight=10000</code>；而 v1 默认 <code>shares=1024</code> 折算后约 <code>weight=39</code>——远小于 v2 默认的 100。这正是很多从 v1 切到 v2 的服务&quot;权重看似没变、实际份额翻倍&quot;的根因：默认值本身的锚点变了。</p>\n<p>不想按 1–10000 计算时，可用 <code>cpu.weight.nice</code> 作为别名接口，范围 <code>[-20, 19]</code>、默认 <code>0</code>。内核文档指出，因为 nice 区间更小更粗，读取时只能返回&quot;最接近的对应权重&quot;（nearest corresponding weight）——用 nice 写入会损失精度，生产上用整数权重比用 nice 更可预测。</p>\n<p>调度器层面，权重最终落到每任务的 <code>sched_entity</code> 权重上。自 Linux 6.6 起内核把 CFS 替换为 <strong>EEVDF</strong>（Earliest Eligible Virtual Deadline First，来源：kernel.org <code>scheduler/sched-eevdf.html</code>）：每个任务维护虚拟运行时间并派生 <strong>lag</strong> 值，lag ≥ 0（eligible）者才可被调度，其中虚拟截止时间最早者先运行。调度权重仍来自 cgroup 层级，但 EEVDF 的期限机制额外偏向短时间片的低延迟请求。实践含义：调 <code>cpu.weight</code> 只影响长期占比，不改变单请求的唤醒延迟；改善尾延迟要走配额与周期那一侧。</p>\n<h2 id=\"cpu-max-带宽限流的配额与周期\">cpu.max：带宽限流的配额与周期</h2><p><code>cpu.max</code> 是两值文件，格式 <code>$MAX $PERIOD</code>，单位均为微秒，默认 <code>&quot;max 100000&quot;</code>——<code>max</code> 表示不设限，周期 100 毫秒（kernel.org cgroup-v2 文档）。写入约定：写两个值同时更新上限与周期；<strong>只写一个数字时只更新 <code>$MAX</code></strong>，周期保持原值。这条约定让&quot;临时放开/收紧配额&quot;变得安全，不必每次重复抄写周期。</p>\n<p>配额语义是&quot;每个周期内最多消耗多少 CPU 时间&quot;，因此单核上限由配额与周期之比给出：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>cores</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>MAX</mtext><mtext>PERIOD</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{\\text{cores}} = \\frac{\\text{MAX}}{\\text{PERIOD}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">cores</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">PERIOD</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MAX</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>写 <code>&quot;50000 100000&quot;</code> 得到 0.5 核；写 <code>&quot;400000 100000&quot;</code> 得到 4 核。配额可以超过周期（多核），这正是容器 <code>--cpus=4</code> 在 cgroup v2 下的落点。周期在实践中可用范围是 1000–1000000 微秒（1 毫秒–1 秒），内核会校验该区间。</p>\n<p>限流的执行方式是：cgroup 在每个周期拿到一份运行时预算，组内所有任务共享；预算耗尽后组内所有任务被<strong>节流</strong>（throttled），直到下个周期开始。v2 与 v1 在这里的差别值得强调——v1 的 <code>cpu.cfs_quota_us</code> 按每个 CPU 独立计时，v2 改为整组单一预算统一计时，因此 v2 节流边界更清晰，但也意味着一个线程打满预算会连带冻结同组其他线程。</p>\n<p><code>cpu.max.burst</code>（默认 <code>0</code>，范围 <code>[0, $MAX]</code>）用来吸收突发：允许 cgroup 在未用满预算时累积少量额度、在需要时一次性释放。对&quot;平时安静、偶发尖峰&quot;的服务（如 cron 批处理、冷启动预热）有用；对持续压满的负载没有帮助，因为累积额度终有上限。</p>\n<h2 id=\"限流诊断-cpu-stat-与节流长尾\">限流诊断：cpu.stat 与节流长尾</h2><p><code>cpu.stat</code> 无论控制器是否启用都存在，其中 <code>usage_usec</code>、<code>user_usec</code>、<code>system_usec</code> 恒定上报，覆盖本 cgroup 及其后代；而 <code>nr_periods</code>、<code>nr_throttled</code>、<code>throttled_usec</code>、<code>nr_bursts</code>、<code>burst_usec</code> 只在控制器启用、且任务走公平调度类时才上报（kernel.org cgroup-v2 文档）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>排查用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>usage_usec</code></td>\n<td>本组及后代累计 CPU 微秒</td>\n<td>计算用量基线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>nr_periods</code></td>\n<td>经历的调度周期数</td>\n<td>换算观察窗口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>nr_throttled</code></td>\n<td>被节流的周期数</td>\n<td>节流频率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>throttled_usec</code></td>\n<td>累计被节流时长</td>\n<td>量化&quot;被罚站&quot;时间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>nr_bursts</code> / <code>burst_usec</code></td>\n<td>突发额度命中次数与时长</td>\n<td>burst 是否被用上</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>语义细节：这五个带宽统计字段是<strong>非层级</strong>的（non-hierarchical），只统计&quot;本 cgroup 自己的 limit 造成的节流&quot;，不含来自祖先的节流。子组被父组上限卡住时，它自己的 <code>throttled_usec</code> 可能毫无变化——排查节流一定要沿祖先链逐级查看。</p>\n<p>量化节流严重程度，可以用&quot;被节流时间占自身上限时间的比例&quot;作为告警指标：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>throttle</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>throttled_usec</mtext><mtext>usage_usec</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{\\text{throttle}} = \\frac{\\text{throttled\\_usec}}{\\text{usage\\_usec}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">throttle</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3904em;vertical-align:-0.996em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3944em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">usage_usec</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">throttled_usec</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.996em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>实践中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>throttle</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{\\text{throttle}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">throttle</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 持续超过 5% 通常已能解释可观测到的 P99 抖动，因为节流是<strong>整组冻结</strong>：某周期预算耗尽后该组所有线程一起等到下个周期，表现为毫秒级停顿尖峰而非平滑降速。这也解释了为什么&quot;配额不变、只把周期从 100ms 调到 10ms&quot;会让尾延迟恶化——同样额度被切成十份，每份更小，组内线程更易在周期边界互相挤兑。调优方向因此是：<strong>保持默认 100ms 周期，下调 <code>$MAX</code> 而不是下调周期</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[&quot;观察 P99 尾延迟抖动&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;读 cpu.stat&lt;br/&gt;throttled_usec / nr_throttled&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; C{&quot;本层是否节流?&quot;}&#10;  C --&gt;|&quot;是&quot;| D[&quot;扩大 cpu.max 的 MAX&lt;br/&gt;或保持周期 100ms 不动&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt;|&quot;否&quot;| E[&quot;沿祖先链向上逐级读 cpu.stat&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt; F{&quot;祖先层是否节流?&quot;}&#10;  F --&gt;|&quot;是&quot;| G[&quot;调整祖先配额&lt;br/&gt;或与邻居协商权重&quot;]&#10;  F --&gt;|&quot;否&quot;| H[&quot;排除 CPU 争抢&lt;br/&gt;转向内存/IO 控制器&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n  A[\"观察 P99 尾延迟抖动\"] --&gt; B[\"读 cpu.stat&lt;br/&gt;throttled_usec / nr_throttled\"]\n  B --&gt; C{\"本层是否节流?\"}\n  C --&gt;|\"是\"| D[\"扩大 cpu.max 的 MAX&lt;br/&gt;或保持周期 100ms 不动\"]\n  C --&gt;|\"否\"| E[\"沿祖先链向上逐级读 cpu.stat\"]\n  E --&gt; F{\"祖先层是否节流?\"}\n  F --&gt;|\"是\"| G[\"调整祖先配额&lt;br/&gt;或与邻居协商权重\"]\n  F --&gt;|\"否\"| H[\"排除 CPU 争抢&lt;br/&gt;转向内存/IO 控制器\"]</pre><h2 id=\"权重与配额的组合-以及-systemd-落点\">权重与配额的组合，以及 systemd 落点</h2><p>两条约束的交互可以用一句话总结：<strong>权重决定&quot;在配额之内怎么分&quot;，配额决定&quot;最多能拿多少&quot;</strong>。顺序是先撞配额、再按权重分摊；只有当整机 CPU 饱和时权重才起作用。因此共享节点上只设权重不设配额是最常见的隐患——邻居一突发，你的服务就在自己的权重比例里被一起拖慢，而且因为没有配额，节流指标里什么也看不到。</p>\n<p>层级叠加时，子 cgroup 的有效上限是祖先链上的最小值：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>MAX</mtext><mtext>eff</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mtext>MAX</mtext><mtext>self</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mtext>MAX</mtext><mtext>parent</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mtext>MAX</mtext><mtext>grandparent</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{MAX}_{\\text{eff}} = \\min(\\text{MAX}_{\\text{self}}, \\text{MAX}_{\\text{parent}}, \\text{MAX}_{\\text{grandparent}}, \\dots)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MAX</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">eff</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MAX</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">self</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MAX</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">parent</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MAX</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">grandparent</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这意味着 Kubernetes 里给 Pod 设的 limit 实际生效值受其所在 QoS cgroup、节点预留 cgroup 层层夹逼；排查&quot;Limit 设了 4 核却只拿到 3 核&quot;时，答案常在祖先的 <code>cpu.max</code> 而不是 Pod 自己的。</p>\n<p>systemd 是绝大多数发行版管理这些文件的入口（<code>systemd.resource-control(5)</code>，freedesktop.org）。对应关系：<code>CPUWeight=</code> 写 <code>cpu.weight</code>（默认 100，范围 1–10000）；<code>CPUQuota=</code> 写 <code>cpu.max</code>，语法如 <code>CPUQuota=50%</code> 等价于 <code>&quot;50000 100000&quot;</code>；<code>CPUQuotaPeriodSec=</code> 改周期。要强调一点：<code>CPUWeight=</code> 与旧的 <code>CPUShares=</code> 是<strong>互斥别名</strong>，同一 unit 里同时写会报错，且 <code>CPUShares=</code> 沿用 v1 的 2–262144 区间——混用两套锚点正是前面&quot;份额翻倍&quot;故事的由来之一。容器侧同样直接：Docker/containerd 的 <code>--cpu-shares</code> 落 <code>cpu.weight</code>，<code>--cpus</code> / <code>--cpu-quota</code> 落 <code>cpu.max</code>。</p>\n<p>最后是 <code>cpu.idle</code>（只对叶子 cgroup 有效）：启用后该组 <code>cpu.weight</code> 读数为 <code>0</code>，组内任务只在 CPU 真正空闲时才被调度——权重是&quot;少分一点&quot;，<code>cpu.idle</code> 是&quot;别人不要我才能用&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>CPU 控制器是<strong>两个正交旋钮</strong>：<code>cpu.weight</code> 管相对份额（争抢时生效），<code>cpu.max</code> 管绝对上限（始终生效）。只设其一都可能与预期不符。</li>\n<li><code>cpu.weight</code> 默认 100、范围 <code>[1, 10000]</code>；份额按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>j</mi></msub><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_i = C \\cdot w_i / \\sum_j w_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1858em;vertical-align:-0.4358em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 在活跃兄弟间分配，空闲兄弟不稀释份额。</li>\n<li>v1→v2 换算是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mn>9999</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>262142</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w = 1 + (s-2)\\times 9999 / 262142</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">9999/262142</span></span></span></span></span>，v1 默认 <code>shares=1024</code> 只折合约 39——默认锚点变了，迁移后份额普遍偏高，务必重新校准。</li>\n<li><code>cpu.max</code> 格式 <code>$MAX $PERIOD</code>（微秒），默认 <code>&quot;max 100000&quot;</code>；单写一个值只改上限，多核上限 = <code>MAX / PERIOD</code>。</li>\n<li>节流是<strong>整组冻结</strong>：<code>throttled_usec/usage_usec</code> 持续超 5% 就足以解释 P99 抖动；调优时降 <code>$MAX</code>，不要缩短周期。</li>\n<li>带宽统计字段<strong>非层级</strong>，只反映本层自身的限流；排查节流必须沿祖先链逐级读 <code>cpu.stat</code>。</li>\n<li>自 Linux 6.6 起调度器为 EEVDF，权重落到调度实体的长期占比，尾延迟由配额与周期主导，不要指望调权重改善单请求延迟。</li>\n<li>systemd 落点：<code>CPUWeight=</code>→<code>cpu.weight</code>，<code>CPUQuota=</code>→<code>cpu.max</code>；<code>CPUWeight=</code> 与 <code>CPUShares=</code> 互斥，混用即锚点错配。</li>\n<li>共享节点最佳实践：配额兜底防邻居拖累，权重在同层做优先级区分。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>延伸阅读：本 hub 内先读 <a href=\"../cgroup-v2-hierarchy-model/internal-process-constraint\">内部进程约束与 no-internal-process 规则</a> 理解为什么 CPU 控制器的层级语义要求进程不可跨组存在，再回到本章 <a href=\"./\">资源控制器深入</a> 看内存与 IO 控制器如何与 CPU 侧组合出完整的资源边界。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"CPU 控制器：cpu.weight 权重分摊与 cpu.max 带宽限流","id":"cpu-控制器-cpu-weight-权重分摊与-cpu-max-带宽限流"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"cpu.weight：权重分摊的机制与换算","id":"cpu-weight-权重分摊的机制与换算"},{"level":2,"text":"cpu.max：带宽限流的配额与周期","id":"cpu-max-带宽限流的配额与周期"},{"level":2,"text":"限流诊断：cpu.stat 与节流长尾","id":"限流诊断-cpu-stat-与节流长尾"},{"level":2,"text":"权重与配额的组合，以及 systemd 落点","id":"权重与配额的组合-以及-systemd-落点"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"cgroup 命名空间、挂载与视图传播边界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/linux-cgroup-v2-resource-isolation-deep-dive/cgroup-v2-hierarchy-model/namespace-mount-view"},"next":{"title":"内存控制器：memory.max/high/low 与回收压力传导","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/linux-cgroup-v2-resource-isolation-deep-dive/resource-controllers-deep/memory-controller-limit-reclaim"}}